      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "什麼是RT",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>放射治療會使用高能光子束來破壞癌細胞:例如 X 射線、伽馬射線、電子束或質子。</p><p><a href=\"/oncology-services/radiation-therapy/#What-is-RT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看更多</a></p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "RT的應用",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<ul><li>根治性放射治療</li><li>輔助性放射治療</li><li>紓緩性放射治療<br /><small></small></li></ul><p><a href=\"/oncology-services/radiation-therapy/#Applications-of-RT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看更多</a></p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "RT的技術方案",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<ul><li>傳統放射治療</li><li>立體定位放射手術(SRT)</li></ul><p><a href=\"/oncology-services/radiation-therapy/#RT-techniques\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看更多</a></p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "RT的工作流程",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>每一個治療都是精準而且為每隻動物專門訂製的。</p><p><a href=\"/oncology-services/radiation-therapy/#RT-workflow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看流程圖</a></p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "適合進行放射治療的腫瘤類型及案例",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p><a href=\"/oncology-services/radiation-therapy/#Tumours-suitable-for-RT-and-case-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">適合進行放射治療的腫瘤類型及案例 </a></p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
